 {"copy_key":"statementBody","value_en":"I have spent more than eight years in banking, mostly where operations meet data. Producing reports is only half the job; the other half is making sure the numbers hold up when someone actually uses them.","value_id":"Lebih dari delapan tahun di perbankan, sebagian besar waktu saya di persimpangan antara operasional dan data. Menghasilkan laporan hanya separuh pekerjaan; separuh lainnya memastikan angkanya tetap berdiri saat benar-benar dipakai.","updated_at":"2026-10-21T16:46:50.941+00:00"}, 
 {"copy_key":"impactLabel","value_en":"Career impact","value_id":"Dampak karier","updated_at":"2026-10-21T16:46:50.941+00:00"}, 
 {"copy_key":"impactTitle","value_en":"Small fixes.\nBig time savings.","value_id":"Perbaikan kecil.\nWaktu yang terasa.","updated_at":"2026-10-21T16:46:50.941+00:00"}, 
 {"copy_key":"impactBody","value_en":"Changes that gave my team hours back every single week.","value_id":"Perubahan yang mengembalikan waktu tim saya setiap minggunya.","updated_at":"2026-10-21T16:46:50.941+00:00"}, 
